  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Wheat-to-Bread Value Chain-UNDP-SYR-00126736</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to address the critical need for rural economic recovery through Rural-based Sustainable Livelihoods (RSL). Focusing on Al-Hasakeh Governorate, the initiative centers on rehabilitating smallholders irrigation systems and water harvesting facilities along the Khabour River. This strategic move is crucial for re-establishing agricultural water access, reviving farming, and enhancing productivity, especially in a region that formerly contributed significantly to the countrys whea</narrative>
  </description>
